# ============================================================
# 4. PRODUCTS PAGE — GENERAL
# ============================================================

msgid "Nuestros Productos"
msgstr "Our Products"

msgid "Café de origen, calidad que se siente"
msgstr "Origin coffee, quality you can taste"

msgid ""
"Ofrecemos granos de café de alta calidad, cultivados con prácticas "
"sostenibles en el Valle de Río Tambo, listos para los mercados más "
"exigentes."
msgstr ""
"We offer high-quality coffee beans, grown using sustainable practices in "
"the Tambo River Valley and ready for the most demanding markets."

msgid "Agregar al carrito"
msgstr "Add to cart"

msgid "Misión"
msgstr "Mission"

msgid ""
"Ofrecer café de calidad, producido responsablemente y con compromiso "
"hacia nuestros clientes y productores."
msgstr ""
"To offer quality coffee produced responsibly, with a commitment to our "
"customers and producers."

msgid "Visión"
msgstr "Vision"

msgid ""
"Fortalecer nuestra presencia en los mercados nacionales e internacionales "
"mediante productos de calidad."
msgstr ""
"To strengthen our presence in national and international markets through "
"quality products."

msgid "Calidad desde el origen"
msgstr "Quality from the source"

msgid "Café desde el origen"
msgstr "Coffee from the source"

msgid "¿Quieres conocer nuestros productos?"
msgstr "Would you like to learn about our products?"

msgid "Contáctanos para conocer más sobre nuestra oferta."
msgstr "Contact us to learn more about our offering."

msgid "Contáctanos"
msgstr "Contact us"


# ============================================================
# 5. PRODUCTS PAGE — GREEN COFFEE
# ============================================================

msgid "Café Verde"
msgstr "Green Coffee"

msgid ""
"Grano crudo de alta calidad, ideal para procesos de selección y tostado."
msgstr "High-quality raw coffee beans, ideal for sorting and roasting."

msgid "100 por ciento orgánico."
msgstr "100 percent organic."

msgid "Alta calidad."
msgstr "High quality."

msgid "Cultivado en el Valle de Río Tambo."
msgstr "Grown in the Tambo River Valley."


# ============================================================
# 6. PRODUCTS PAGE — PARCHMENT COFFEE
# ============================================================

msgid "Café Pergamino"
msgstr "Parchment Coffee"

msgid ""
"Grano con capa de pergamino, seleccionado cuidadosamente de nuestras "
"fincas."
msgstr ""
"Coffee beans with a parchment layer, carefully selected from our farms."

msgid "Proceso natural."
msgstr "Natural process."


# ============================================================
# 7. PRODUCTS PAGE — MCM GREEN COFFEE
# ============================================================

msgid "Café oro MCM"
msgstr "MCM Green Coffee"

msgid ""
"Café seleccionado y listo para procesos de exportación, con origen Río Tambo."
msgstr ""
"Selected coffee from Río Tambo, ready for export processing."

msgid "Presentación: quintal de 46 kg."
msgstr "Presentation: 46 kg quintal."

msgid "Variedades: Caturra, Castillo, Geisha y Catimor."
msgstr "Varieties: Caturra, Castillo, Geisha, and Catimor."

msgid "Precio según mercado de Nueva York y diferencial."
msgstr ""
"Price based on the New York market and the applicable differential."


# ============================================================
# 8. PRODUCTS PAGE — ROASTED COFFEE
# ============================================================

msgid "Café tostado"
msgstr "Roasted Coffee"

msgid ""
"Café de especialidad tostado y molido para disfrutar el origen Cana Edén "
"en casa."
msgstr ""
"Specialty coffee, roasted and ground to enjoy the Cana Edén origin at home."

msgid "Bolsas trilaminadas de 250 g, 500 g y 1 kg."
msgstr "Three-layer bags of 250 g, 500 g, and 1 kg."

msgid "Envío por agencia; el flete lo paga el cliente."
msgstr ""
"Shipping is handled by a transport agency; the customer pays the freight."

msgid "Promociones disponibles por temporada."
msgstr "Seasonal promotions available."


# ============================================================
# 9. ABOUT US PAGE — INTRODUCTION
# ============================================================

msgid ""
"Conoce a la Cooperativa Agraria Cafetalera Río Tambo, de Satipo, Junín: "
"nuestra historia, misión, visión, valores, origen del café y registros."
msgstr ""
"Get to know the Río Tambo Agricultural Coffee Cooperative in Satipo, "
"Junín: our history, mission, vision, values, coffee origins, and records."

msgid "Nuestra Cooperativa"
msgstr "Our Cooperative"

msgid ""
"Unidos por un café de calidad, comprometidos con un futuro sostenible."
msgstr "United by quality coffee, committed to a sustainable future."

msgid "Quiénes somos"
msgstr "Who We Are"

msgid "Una organización de productores de Río Tambo"
msgstr "A Producers' Organization in Río Tambo"

msgid ""
"La Cooperativa Agraria Cafetalera Río Tambo Ltda. es una organización de "
"productores comprometidos con la calidad, la sostenibilidad y el "
"desarrollo de nuestras comunidades."
msgstr ""
"Río Tambo Agricultural Coffee Cooperative Ltd. is a producers' "
"organization committed to quality, sustainability, and the development "
"of our communities."

msgid ""
"Fundada el 20 de agosto de 2017, cuenta con 95 socios en el distrito de "
"Río Tambo, provincia de Satipo, región Junín. Nos dedicamos a la "
"producción, acopio y comercialización de café y de otros productos "
"agrícolas de la zona."
msgstr ""
"Founded on August 20, 2017, the cooperative has 95 members in Río Tambo "
"District, Satipo Province, Junín Region. We produce, collect, and market "
"coffee and other agricultural products from the area."

msgid ""
"Trabajamos para llevar café peruano al mundo, respetando nuestra tierra "
"y nuestras tradiciones."
msgstr ""
"We work to bring Peruvian coffee to the world while respecting our land "
"and traditions."

msgid ""
"Productor de café cosechando cerezas en una plantación de montaña"
msgstr "Coffee farmer harvesting coffee cherries on a mountain plantation"

msgid "Desde 2017"
msgstr "Since 2017"


# ============================================================
# 10. ABOUT US PAGE — MISSION AND VISION
# ============================================================

msgid "Misión y visión"
msgstr "Mission and Vision"

msgid "Qué hacemos"
msgstr "What We Do"

msgid "Nuestra misión"
msgstr "Our Mission"

msgid ""
"Mejorar la calidad de vida de nuestros socios a través de la producción "
"y comercialización de café de alta calidad."
msgstr ""
"To improve our members' quality of life through the production and "
"marketing of high-quality coffee."

msgid "A dónde vamos"
msgstr "Where We Are Headed"

msgid "Nuestra visión"
msgstr "Our Vision"

msgid ""
"Ser una cooperativa reconocida a nivel nacional e internacional por "
"nuestro café sostenible y de excelencia."
msgstr ""
"To be a nationally and internationally recognized cooperative known for "
"sustainable, excellent-quality coffee."


